{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_4_level_main_04-02_beg",
  "groupId": "main_4",
  "stageId": "main_04-02",
  "title": "A Walk in the Rain",
  "storyCode": "4-2",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2827ef7087120945f5c5d66d0d231cd791395a6aad3b196ca786a7387ca7077e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "Th-there are two enemies left!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "They're running toward the building to our east--"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "I've already locked on to them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Argh...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Bullseye."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "Aren't we making too much noise?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "There are a ton of explosions all over the city. I don't think they'll notice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Have you notified Dr. Kal'tsit yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "I called her before the battle started."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "There's evidence that Reunion is conducting their operations in this city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "I haven't hung up yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "Shouldn't we be a bit stealthier with our movements?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "That Reunion member just now seemed to be using Detection-type Arts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "We'll have to strike first so that we don't give away our location."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "At least, we can't give these Reunion squads time to communicate with each other."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "Phew... It's finally over..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Frostleaf, assess the situation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "Here, hold on to the comms device."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Jessica, don't let your guard down yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "Of course... I'm aware of that!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "All right, all right. I won't mention it again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit, can you hear me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Always could. Indeed, you can't afford to let your guard down yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Jessica, there might be an enemy behind you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "Uwaaah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "H-how did they... get behind me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "...Eeehh??"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "If I can attack you from behind, that means you were too slow."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "We're fine for now, Dr. Kal'tsit. I've taken out the enemy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "You really are fast..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "I couldn't even see how you managed to get over there and come back so quickly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "--Actually, I never even left."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Projekt Red contacted me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "There are no signs of activity from the Reunion forces hiding in Lungmen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "At this stage, it'd be best not to poke the hornet's nest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "By the way, according to the intel I've received from the other recon teams, there may a fairly substantial Reunion presence in the desert."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "In other words, we're the ones who hit the jackpot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "That does put a bit of pressure on us. We're also only a recon team after all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "If that's the case, we've already eliminated two Reunion squads so far..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Are you absolutely sure about the affiliation of the enemies we first exchanged fire with, Jessica?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "Yeah, there shouldn't be any mistake. I double checked before asking you to shoot."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "...My bad. I was busy calculating the ballistic trajectory."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "What about the enemy's numbers?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "We don't know the exact number."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Frostleaf, how's it going over there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "What's the matter...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Go take care of it. Let me know right away if there's an issue."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "Will do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "Let's... head over to her to see what's going on."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "What happened?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "...You two didn't feel it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "Huh? What..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "The temperature."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "Now that you mentioned it... it does seem colder..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "The temperature."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "...Indeed. There's at least a five-degree difference compared to the temperature outside."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "How could such fair weather... change so suddenly..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "Look above you. The weather hasn't changed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "...Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "It's not the weather."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "It's coming from here. Come, feel this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "...The walls of the ruins?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "That's right. These walls are heat-absorbing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "...No way?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "Before we came, the heat absorption had probably already worn off."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "It's returning to the previous temperature."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "But, why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "Who would leave behind something like this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "...Reunion are the only ones who've been active in these parts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "Reunion? Could they... do something like this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "The Infected..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "I once heard of a certain legend."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "...about a creature called the 'yeti.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "...I have a feeling... that this is going to get real troublesome..."
    },
